---
description: Project Architecture
alwaysApply: true
---

Layers

Presentation

↓

Application

↓

Domain

↓

Infrastructure

↓

Database

Repositories must never contain business logic.

Business logic belongs to Application.

DTO ← Mapper ← Entity

No circular dependency.

Use MediatR pattern.

Use CQRS where applicable.

Prefer Specification Pattern for complex filtering.